{"asset_key":"ep4/gameplay_story_14604600","episode":"ep4","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"14604600","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1460460001:1":{"text":"난 진정한 영웅이야! 드래곤도 내 검 아래 무릎을 꿇었지. 난 무적이야!","source_cn":"我就是真正的英雄！龙也臣服在我的剑下！我所向无敌！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x710739C16B833D11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1460460002:1":{"text":"네가 파나의 오빠니? 네 동생이 방금...","source_cn":"你是珀娜的哥哥吗？你妹妹刚刚——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1CDF86AC71EB784","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1460460003:1":{"text":"아, 공주님! 공주님이 축복해 주신다면 저는 이 대륙을 정복할 수도 있어요!","source_cn":"啊，公主啊，只要有你的祝福，我愿意征服整个大陆！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68C80C983C4CFA3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1460460004:1":{"text":"...네 오빠가, 설마...","source_cn":"……你哥哥他该不会……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27D5C1AA552AD702","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1460460005:1":{"text":"윽, 오빠가 저희보다 훨씬 더 심한 거 같아요.","source_cn":"呃，他的毛病可能比我们更严重一点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85A77DF918D489A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1460460006:1":{"text":"저흰 그냥 지상에서 모험하는 걸 상상하는 정도였잖아요. 뭐 싸운다, 이긴다, 풍경이 어떻다 이런 거요.","source_cn":"我们只是幻想去地面上冒险，最多也只是想象下战斗啦胜利啦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1B0BDB854876B31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1460460007:1":{"text":"그런데 오빠는 이미 모험을 끝내고 위대한 영웅이 됐다고 생각하는 모양이에요...","source_cn":"但他好像认为自己已经冒险成功，如今就是了不起的大英雄了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D50A90D9858D9EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1460460008:1":{"text":"내가 셀로클랜드에 새로운 미래를 가져왔어! 난 진정한 영웅이야!","source_cn":"我，将为萨洛克兰带来全新的未来！我就是真正的英雄！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x600E4C24BA7A30D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1460460009:1":{"text":"오빠 정도는 괜찮은 편이에요. 다른 언니 오빠들은 자기가 위대한 인듀어 님의 화신이라고 생각하거든요...","source_cn":"我哥哥这样还好，还有其他的哥哥姐姐幻想自己就是因度厄大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE7DBDAC4BB7C40E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1460460010:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 이거 확실히 병이 맞는 거 같아.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2FE51E255D1BFEBA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 이거 확실히 병이 맞는 거 같아.","female":"<style=